  "intro": {
    "text": "Question words make a sentence a question on their own, so they never take `mI`: *Bu kim?* (Who is this?), *Nasılsın?* (How are you?). Like other words, they can carry the ending of **to be**: *Sen kimsin?* (Who are you?).",
    "see": "gp-question-words"
  },
